---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Focomo">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy for Focomo</h1>
    
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4"><strong>Effective Date</strong>: August 5, 2025</p>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8"><strong>Last Updated</strong>: August 5, 2025</p>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Introduction</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Focomo ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use the Focomo app ("the App").</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Data Collection and Use</h2>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Information We Collect</h3>
      
      <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-2">Focus Session Data (Local Storage Only)</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Timer duration and completion status</li>
        <li>Session start and end times</li>
        <li>Focus streak and productivity analytics</li>
        <li>Achievement and milestone progress</li>
        <li>User preferences and settings</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-2">Device Information</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Device model and iOS version for performance optimization</li>
        <li>App usage analytics to improve user experience</li>
        <li>Crash reports to maintain app stability</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">How We Use Your Information</h3>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-2">Core App Functionality</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Track your focus sessions and productivity patterns</li>
        <li>Calculate daily, weekly, and monthly analytics</li>
        <li>Provide personalized achievement celebrations</li>
        <li>Remember your preferred timer durations and settings</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-2">App Improvement</h4>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Analyze usage patterns to enhance features</li>
        <li>Identify and fix technical issues</li>
        <li>Optimize 3D performance across different devices</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Data Storage and Security</h2>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Local Storage</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>All focus session data is stored locally on your device using SwiftData</li>
        <li>Your productivity history never leaves your device unless you explicitly choose to sync</li>
        <li>You maintain complete control over your focus data</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Optional iCloud Sync</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>If enabled, focus session data syncs across your Apple devices via iCloud</li>
        <li>Apple's iCloud encryption protects your data in transit and at rest</li>
        <li>You can disable iCloud sync at any time in Settings</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Security Measures</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>All data is encrypted using iOS security frameworks</li>
        <li>No focus session data is transmitted to our servers</li>
        <li>The app works fully offline with no internet connection required</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">What We Don't Use</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>No advertising networks or tracking SDKs</li>
        <li>No social media integration requiring personal data</li>
        <li>No analytics services that collect personal information</li>
        <li>No user accounts or authentication systems</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Apple Services Integration</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Do Not Disturb</strong>: Automatically activated during focus sessions</li>
        <li><strong>HealthKit</strong>: Future integration for wellness tracking (optional)</li>
        <li><strong>Core Haptics</strong>: Enhanced user experience with tactile feedback</li>
        <li><strong>Spatial Audio</strong>: Immersive audio environments</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Your Privacy Rights</h2>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Data Control</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Access</strong>: View all your focus data within the app's analytics section</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion</strong>: Delete individual sessions or reset all data in Settings</li>
        <li><strong>Export</strong>: Export your focus history for personal use</li>
        <li><strong>Portability</strong>: Move your data between devices via iCloud sync</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Communication Preferences</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>In-App Notifications</strong>: Control achievement and reminder notifications</li>
        <li><strong>Focus Mode Integration</strong>: Manage Do Not Disturb automation</li>
        <li><strong>Update Notifications</strong>: App Store handles all app update communications</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Focomo is designed for users of all ages and contains no age-inappropriate content. The app:
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Collects no personal information from users of any age</li>
        <li>Requires no user accounts or registration</li>
        <li>Contains no social features or communication capabilities</li>
        <li>Includes no advertising or in-app purchases that target children</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Parents can safely allow children to use Focomo for homework and study sessions.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Data Retention</h2>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">Local Data</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
        <li>Focus session data remains on your device until you delete it</li>
        <li>You can delete individual sessions or reset all data at any time</li>
        <li>Uninstalling the app removes all local data permanently</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-700 mt-6 mb-3">iCloud Data</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Synced data follows Apple's iCloud retention policies</li>
        <li>Disabling iCloud sync removes data from Apple's servers</li>
        <li>Deleting data locally also removes it from iCloud sync</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our practices or applicable laws. We will:
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Post the updated policy in the app and on our support website</li>
        <li>Notify users of significant changes through in-app notifications</li>
        <li>Maintain version history for transparency</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Continued use of the app after policy updates constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Contact Information</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Email</strong>: support@focomo.app</li>
        <li><strong>Website</strong>: https://focomo.app</li>
        <li><strong>Response Time</strong>: We aim to respond within 2 business days</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">For technical issues or feature requests, please use the in-app feedback option.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Legal Compliance</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">This Privacy Policy complies with:
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Apple App Store Review Guidelines</li>
        <li>California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</li>
        <li>General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) for EU users</li>
        <li>Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Conclusion</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Focomo is designed as a privacy-first productivity app. We believe your focus data should remain private and under your control. This app helps you build better focus habits without compromising your privacy.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">By choosing local storage and optional iCloud sync, we ensure your productivity journey remains personal and secure.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
</file>